## Step 7: Model Evaluation

### 7.1 Summary Comparison Table
# Build comparison table
metrics_df = pd.DataFrame({
    name: {
        'Accuracy':  round(r['accuracy'],  4),
        'Precision': round(r['precision'], 4),
        'Recall':    round(r['recall'],    4),
        'F1-Score':  round(r['f1'],        4),
